%% title: Authenticate a deploy call with a GitHub OIDC token
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as deploy job
    participant GO as GitHub OIDC
    participant S as estate-kit service
    CI->>GO: request an ID token, audience estate-kit
    GO-->>CI: JWT
    CI->>S: deploy, Bearer JWT
    S->>S: repository_id admitted?
    S->>S: pinned workflow and environment?
    S-->>CI: rollout id
